flowchart TD
  A[Start meal analysis] --> B{Client input valid?}
  B -- No --> B1[Return validation error<br>for example invalid path or file type]
  B1 --> Z[Show user-facing error]

  B -- Yes --> C[Upload image and invoke analyze-meal]
  C --> D{Edge request accepted?}

  D -- No --> D1[Return transport or auth error]
  D1 --> Z

  D -- Yes --> E[Call primary model]
  E --> F{Model response status}

  F -- Success --> G[Validate structured JSON payload]
  G --> H{Payload valid?}
  H -- No --> H1[Return parsing or schema error]
  H1 --> Z
  H -- Yes --> I[Return analysis_id + items + totals]
  I --> J[Render result for user review]

  F -- Retryable error<br>408 429 5xx or retryable network --> K{Retries remaining?}
  K -- Yes --> L[Retry same model call]
  L --> F
  K -- No --> M{Fallback model available?}

  M -- Yes --> N[Switch to fallback model]
  N --> O{Fallback response success?}
  O -- Yes --> G
  O -- No --> P[Map provider error to user-safe message]
  P --> Z

  M -- No --> P

  F -- Non-retryable error --> P

  Z --> Q[User decides retry later<br>or choose quick add]
  Q --> R[End failure path]